# The API image is built from the repo root (apps/api/Dockerfile). Keep secrets and local state out of the
# build context: `COPY apps/api apps/api` would otherwise bake apps/api/.env into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.next
**/.vercel
data
apps/web
supabase/.temp
.git
